  <h2 class="font-serif font-medium text-xl sm:text-2xl mt-10 mb-4">Your account</h2>

  <p class="mb-6">
    You are responsible for the accuracy of the information on your account and for keeping your credentials secure. Tell us promptly at <a href="mailto:support@pixel-master.com" class="text-casebound-green underline underline-offset-4">support@pixel-master.com</a> if you believe your account has been accessed by someone else. One person, one account. Do not impersonate anyone, and do not choose a username or display name designed to suggest you are someone you are not.
  </p>

  <h2 class="font-serif font-medium text-xl sm:text-2xl mt-10 mb-4">Your content</h2>

