    <li><strong>Book metadata is shared.</strong> Corrections and additions you make to a book's title, authors, page count, cover, publisher or genre become part of Casebound's shared catalogue, used by every user. That contribution is perpetual and survives deletion of your account, because other users' libraries depend on it. It is not personal to you and is not attributed to you publicly.</li>
